From f3807958ba3c9abeb9165e6b831ef341c6b8532b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sunwenxiang <sunwenxiang133@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 17:27:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add sophgo custom features to bmcweb

- CPLD info (CPUA/CPUB/CPUO/Other/PSU/EFuse power states)
- CPLD firmware version via D-Bus xyz.openbmc_project.State.CPLD
- SOL port switching (port0-3 -> CPU0UART0/CPU0UART1/CPU1UART0/CPU1UART1)
- SOL log export (/sol/logs reads /var/log/obmc-console.log)
- Fan speed control via sophgo.fanControl ControlMode
- 1684x board temperature display (AiCard_Temp)
- CSP unsafe-eval for WebAssembly
- Mask asdbg user from account service
- LED identify via GPIO instead of LED GroupManager

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [sophgo specific]
